# Configuration A of the load-discrimination experiment: the
# Merlin-shaped single-switch instance at the fixture-default shared
# buffer of 4 MiB. Identical to
# topologies/ss_dragonfly/merlin_a100_5node_4x200g.topo except that it
# lives with the experiment that declares it, so the A/B pair is
# byte-locked next to its registration. Study instance for capability
# and sanity evidence; no claim about the Merlin fabric's real buffer
# sizing is made (Rosetta buffer sizing is unpublished).
#
# Every scored invocation passes -wire_bytes 9038 -header_bytes 90, so
# the max_wire_packet_bytes value below is overridden by the harness
# exactly as in the wave-19 calibration cells.
topology dragonfly
hosts_per_router 20
routers_per_group 1
global_links_per_router 0
groups 1
host_link_gbps 200
host_link_latency_ps 300000
switch_pipeline_ps 350000
rosetta_buffer_bytes 4194304
max_wire_packet_bytes 9038
routing_seed 383530136519245852
